{"id":10072,"name":"steelix-mega","speciesId":208,"dex":208,"form":"mega","generation":2,"types":["steel","ground"],"stats":{"hp":75,"attack":125,"defense":230,"special-attack":55,"special-defense":95,"speed":30},"abilities":[{"name":"sand-force","hidden":false}],"height":105,"weight":7400,"baseExp":214,"sprites":{"normal":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/other/official-artwork/10072.png","shiny":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/other/official-artwork/shiny/10072.png","icon":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/10072.png"},"cry":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/10072.ogg","genus":"Iron Snake Pokémon","genusPt":"Pokémon Cobra de Ferro","flavor":[{"version":"black","text":"It is thought its body transformed as a result of iron accumulating internally from swallowing soil."},{"version":"gold","text":"Its body has been compressed deep under the ground. As a result, it is even harder than a diamond."},{"version":"silver","text":"It is said that if an ONIX lives for over 100 years, its composition changes to become diamond-like."},{"version":"crystal","text":"The many small metal particles that cover this POKéMON's body reflect bright light well."},{"version":"ruby","text":"STEELIX lives even further underground than ONIX. This POKéMON is known to dig towards the earth’s core. There are records of this POKéMON reaching a depth of over six-tenths of a mile underground."},{"version":"emerald","text":"STEELIX live even further underground than ONIX. This POKéMON is known to dig toward the earth’s core, reaching a depth of over six-tenths of a mile underground."},{"version":"leafgreen","text":"Its body has been compressed deep under the ground. As a result, it is even harder than diamond."},{"version":"diamond","text":"Tempered underground under high pressure and heat, its body is harder than any metal."},{"version":"pearl","text":"It chews its way through boulders with its sturdy jaws. Its eyes can see in the darkness underground."},{"version":"soulsilver","text":"It’s said that if an ONIX lives for 100 years, its composition becomes diamondlike as it evolves into a STEELIX."},{"version":"black-2","text":"The iron it ingested with the soil it swallowed transformed its body and made it harder than diamonds."},{"version":"omega-ruby","text":"Steelix lives even further underground than Onix. This Pokémon is known to dig toward the earth’s core. There are records of this Pokémon reaching a depth of over six-tenths of a mile underground."},{"version":"sword","text":"It is said that if an Onix lives for over 100 years, its composition changes to become diamond-like."},{"version":"legends-arceus","text":"This Pokémon evolved through use of a strange item. Its body is coated with steel powder and notably hard—not even diamond can leave so much as a scratch."}],"flavorPt":"Este Pokémon evoluiu através do uso de um item estranho. Seu corpo é revestido com pó de aço e é notavelmente duro – nem mesmo o diamante pode deixar um arranhão.","genderRate":4,"captureRate":25,"eggGroups":["mineral"],"isLegendary":false,"isMythical":false,"evolution":{"species":"onix","speciesId":95,"evolvesTo":[{"conditions":["Troca, Segurando Metal Coat"],"species":"steelix","speciesId":208,"evolvesTo":[]}]},"varieties":[{"id":208,"name":"steelix","form":"normal","sprite":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/other/official-artwork/208.png"},{"id":10072,"name":"steelix-mega","form":"mega","sprite":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/other/official-artwork/10072.png"}],"games":[16,17,18],"moves":[{"id":15,"learn":[[16,"tm",0]]},{"id":20,"learn":[[16,"lv",1],[16,"tutor",0],[17,"lv",1],[18,"lv",1],[18,"tutor",0]]},{"id":21,"learn":[[16,"lv",28],[17,"lv",28],[18,"lv",28]]},{"id":33,"learn":[[16,"lv",1],[17,"lv",1],[18,"lv",1]]},{"id":38,"learn"